{"title": "True Strike", "pageid": 1696, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/True_Strike", "categories": ["Spells", "Cantrips", "Divination spells", "Actions", "Bugs", "Spells that can be cast while silenced"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:True_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/True_Strike.webp/300px-True_Strike.webp, /w/images/f/ff/True_Strike.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/True_Strike.webp/300px-True_Strike.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/True_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>True Strike </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip (Divination)</a>. It gives the caster Advantage on their next Attack Roll against the target.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. \n</p>\nThis spell can be cast while you are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_TrueStrike</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TrueStrike\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TrueStrike\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_True_Strike\"> Condition: True Strike </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\">True Strike</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The spellcaster has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Archer\" title=\"Arcane Archer\">Arcane Archer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li></ul>Races: <ul><li> Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/High_Half-Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Half-Elf\">High Half-Elf</a> </li></ul>\n<p>(<i>Character level</i> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)\n</p>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\">Magic Initiate: Bard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\">Magic Initiate: Sorcerer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Warlock\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Warlock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Warlock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Magic_Initiate_Warlock_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Warlock\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Warlock\">Magic Initiate: Warlock</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Breaker\" title=\"Mage Breaker\">Mage Breaker</a> (Ranger class feature)</li>\n<li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The description of True Strike is among the more confusingly worded, and thus is prone to being misunderstood. Specifically:\n<ul><li>Only the caster of this spell gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on their next attack against the affected target, never their allies.</li>\n<li>Only the first attack roll following the application of the condition gains Advantage. The condition is removed immediately afterward, whether the attack roll is a hit or a miss.</li>\n<li>The duration is 2 turns, but this <i>includes the turn on which the condition is applied</i>. This is true of many spells, but is especially important for short duration spells.</li></ul></li>\n<li>True Strike is rarely considered worth using due to its opportunity cost; a full <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> must be spent on it to improve the chances of hitting <i>once</i>. Most of the time, if two actions are available - whether on the same turn or not - attacking twice is more effective than attacking once with advantage (due to damage bonuses).</li>\n<li><i>However</i>, True Strike is not considered \"aggressive\", so the caster could cast it just before combat to gain its benefits without having to spend an action mid-fight (this eliminates the opportunity cost). The duration is only 2 turns (12 seconds while not in turn-based mode).</li>\n<li>Another niche use case exists for an <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> making a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Sneak Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sneak Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Sneak Attack (Melee)\">Sneak Attack</a>. If the caster is out of spell slots, <i>and</i> no allies can flank for a sneak attack, <i>and</i> there is no other way to gain advantage for an attack roll, spending a single action on True Strike to enable a single sneak attack can be considered efficient.\n<ul><li>In such cases, True Strike can be even more useful when using the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Sneak Attack (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"ranged version\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Sneak_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Sneak Attack (Ranged)\">ranged version</a> of sneak attack, since this allows the caster to benefit from the range of the cantrip, especially with a <a href=\"/wiki/High_Ground_Rules\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Ground Rules\">High Ground</a> bonus. At such distances, however, it is typically easier to just use a Bonus Action to <a href=\"/wiki/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">hide</a> first and obtain Advantage.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Though not displayed in its description, True Strike can be cast while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/True_strike\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/True_strike\">True strike</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.116 seconds\nPreprocessor visit